	<p>
		Licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" rel="license">CC BY 4.0</a>.
	</p>
	<p>
		Not affiliated with or endorsed by Qlik. Qlik and QVD are trademarks of their respective owners.
	</p>
</div>

<style>
	.legal {
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-xs);
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
	}
	.legal p + p {
		margin-top: 0.25rem;
	}
	.legal a {
		color: inherit;
	}
</style>
